			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 11780
			},
			"text": " Hi, here's something I never thought I would see again. Seriously, a brand spanking new Australian electronics magazine."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,200",
				"to": "00:00:18,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12200,
				"to": 18540
			},
			"text": " Look at this, it's called Diode. Do it yourself. Ode? Diode? Get it?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,280",
				"to": "00:00:23,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19280,
				"to": 23900
			},
			"text": " Beautiful! It's brand spanking new. This is the first edition that's come out."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,900",
				"to": "00:00:29,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23900,
				"to": 29020
			},
			"text": " It's published by a guy called Rob Bell. He's the guy behind this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,380",
				"to": "00:00:37,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29380,
				"to": 37300
			},
			"text": " And I never, seriously, I never thought I'd see the day that there'd be another electronics magazine published,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:37,560",
				"to": "00:00:41,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 37560,
				"to": 41540
			},
			"text": " let alone published in good old school dead tree format."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,700",
				"to": "00:00:46,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41700,
				"to": 46480
			},
			"text": " And look at this thing. It looks absolutely fantastic. We'll take a quick look at it in a minute."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:46,480",
				"to": "00:00:53,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 46480,
				"to": 53380
			},
			"text": " But yeah, like back in the, before the internet, we had electronics magazines."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,520",
				"to": "00:01:01,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53520,
				"to": 61260
			},
			"text": " That was pretty much the only thing, only electronics resource that hobbyists like myself had to, you know,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,320",
				"to": "00:01:09,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61320,
				"to": 69160
			},
			"text": " to keep in touch with the industry and projects and, you know, technical articles and all that sort of stuff"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:09,160",
				"to": "00:01:16,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 69160,
				"to": 76500
			},
			"text": " was in these hobby magazines. And back in the day, we had like four or five of them just here in Australia."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:16,500",
				"to": "00:01:21,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 76500,
				"to": 81680
			},
			"text": " I'm not sure about overseas. They had probably just as many, but there was Electronics Australia, of course,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:21,740",
				"to": "00:01:23,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 81740,
				"to": 83500
			},
			"text": " which has been going forever under various..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,520",
				"to": "00:01:29,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83520,
				"to": 89300
			},
			"text": " Different names, Electronics Today International, Australian Electronics Monthly at one point."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,820",
				"to": "00:01:37,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89820,
				"to": 97480
			},
			"text": " There was Talking Electronics, and I've done an awesome series of like five videos interviewing Colin Mitchell from Talking Electronics."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:37,580",
				"to": "00:01:41,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 97580,
				"to": 101680
			},
			"text": " I might have to link those in down below. They're a fascinating watch. Definitely watch those."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:41,680",
				"to": "00:01:49,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 101680,
				"to": 109160
			},
			"text": " And then Silicon Chip. Leo Simpson branched off from Electronics Australia to form Silicon Chip."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:49,360",
				"to": "00:01:53,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 109360,
				"to": 113460
			},
			"text": " And we had, I don't know if there were five at one point."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:53,520",
				"to": "00:01:56,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 113520,
				"to": 116680
			},
			"text": " But I think there were at least four on the newsstands at one point."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:56,780",
				"to": "00:02:01,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 116780,
				"to": 121260
			},
			"text": " And, of course, there is still this sole remaining Australian electronics magazine, Silicon Chip."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:01,360",
				"to": "00:02:04,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 121360,
				"to": 124960
			},
			"text": " Leo Simpson still running that. Still a super quality publication."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:05,260",
				"to": "00:02:08,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 125260,
				"to": 128980
			},
			"text": " It's probably the only electronics magazine in the world, correct me if I'm wrong,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:09,060",
				"to": "00:02:14,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 129060,
				"to": 134360
			},
			"text": " that have an in-house technical team who actually design their own projects."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:14,740",
				"to": "00:02:17,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 134740,
				"to": 137220
			},
			"text": " Diode is not like this. It's a brand new one."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:17,700",
				"to": "00:02:22,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 137700,
				"to": 142820
			},
			"text": " It's basically taking other people's use to submit your content to it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:23,520",
				"to": "00:02:26,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 143520,
				"to": 146180
			},
			"text": " If it's good enough, they will publish it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:26,500",
				"to": "00:02:35,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 146500,
				"to": 155580
			},
			"text": " And Rob is probably an ideal person to do this because he runs like some sort of graphic design business."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
