				"to": "00:02:39,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 155700,
				"to": 159960
			},
			"text": " That's his business. Hence why you're going to see that it looks so fantastic."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:39,960",
				"to": "00:02:47,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 159960,
				"to": 167080
			},
			"text": " Because he knows what he's doing. He's got the team to actually make this look really, really slick."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:47,080",
				"to": "00:02:53,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 167080,
				"to": 173440
			},
			"text": " And it does. So I bet he's got that hobbyist, electronics hobbyist, enthusiast background."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:53,520",
				"to": "00:02:56,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 173520,
				"to": 176640
			},
			"text": " Which you need, the passion, to do something like this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
